OL,3,GNEWSAStudents scramble for
OL,4,Aaccommodation amid shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of prospective university
OL,7,Fstudents say they have been left
OL,8,Fscrambling for housing due to a
OL,9,Fshortage of on-campus accommodation.
OL,11,FChiefs at the University of Exeter said
OL,12,Fthey had met their commitments for
OL,13,Fstudents guaranteed accommodation -
OL,14,Fthose who applied before a 31 July
OL,15,Fdeadline.
OL,17,FHowever, they are unable to offer
OL,18,Fhousing to all the students who applied
OL,19,Foutside of the deadline due to "high
OL,20,Fdemand".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
