OL,3,GNEWSAStudents scramble for
OL,4,Aaccommodation amid shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FNiamh, who is from Birmingham and
OL,7,Fdecided to defer her place after not
OL,8,Fbeing offered accommodation, said: "At
OL,9,Ffirst I just didn't really know what I
OL,10,Fwas doing for this entire year, it was
OL,11,Fa bit of a shock to be left thinking
OL,12,Fyou're going to university for a year
OL,13,Fand then you're not."
